  "reference": "1 Tham 15",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ko̱r kɛ ji̱ Ä-ma-lek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl Thɔɔl jiök i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial ɣä jäk kä ji̱, bä ji̱ yier ala kuäär nɛɛnikɛ ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Täämɛ liŋ ruaacni Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ɛ i̱, ‘Bä ji̱ Ä-ma-lek duäc kɛ mëë cikɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl päth dup, mëë bäkɛ raar kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wër ɛn täämɛ wër näk ji̱ Ä-ma-lek, näk tin diaal tin tekɛ kɛ. Cu duɔ̱ɔ̱r päl thi̱n, näk wutni diaal kɛ män, kɛ gaat, ɣɔ̱k, kɛ muɔ̱li kɛ det kɛ thɔ̱a̱rɔa̱a̱li.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl naath cɔal kä Tɛ-la-im, kä cuɛ kɛ kuɛn ala nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti kur rɛw, kɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ wäl kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl ben liep tɔ̱ɔ̱cä rɛy lo̱o̱lä wec ji̱ Ä-ma-lek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ji̱ Kɛɛn jiök i̱, “Wuɔcɛ rɔ rɛy ji̱ Ä-ma-lek, kiɛ bä yɛ näk kɛ kɛ kɛɛl. Kɛ ɣöö cia ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal lät kä mi gɔaa mëë bäkɛ raar kä I-jëp.” Cu ji̱ Kɛɛn jiɛɛn rɛy ji̱ Ä-ma-lek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ji̱ Ä-ma-lek joc ni kä Ä-wi-la a räth ni kä Cur min la nhiam I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ä-gag käp a tëk, kä cuɛ nɛy diaal näk ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö /ken Thɔɔl Ä-gag näk, kɛnɛ det tin gɔw, kɛnɛ ɣɔ̱k, kɔa̱a̱l tin ci buuth kɛnɛ rueeth deet rɔɔmni, kɛ tin diaal tin gɔw /kenɛ kɛ näk. Kä cuɛ tin diaal tin thil luɔt näk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱k Thɔɔl ala kuäär",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Tha-muɛl wee i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cä duer kɛ ɣöö cä Thɔɔl jak kä Kuäär. Cɛ kac jɔk kä ɣä, kä /cɛ lät ni luëëkä.” Kä cu lɔc Tha-muɛl jiääk, kä cuɛ Kuoth Nhial pal kɛ wäär kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kɛ runwaŋ cu Tha-muɛl keer kɛ ɣöö bɛ Thɔɔl wä lor kä cua jiök i̱, “Ci Thɔɔl wä kä Kar-mɛl. Kä cɛ rɔ ta̱th cuut ɛn wi̱ni, kä cuɛ rɛ̈t kä Gil-gal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Tha-muɛl ben kä Thɔɔl, kä cu Thɔɔl ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ puɔ̱th Kuɔth Nhial tekɛ ji̱. Cä ruac Kuɔth Nhial la̱t.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl ɛ loc i̱, “Kä ɛŋu liɛŋä ce̱tkɛ muaar ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k kɛnɛ det ɛ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl ɛ loc i̱, “Nööŋ kɛn kɛ kä ji̱ Ä-ma-lek. Ca ɣɔk tin gɔw kɛnɛ det päl, kɛ ɣöö bakɛ thöp Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu ala muc. Kä cakɔ duɔthkiɛn näk ni kɛn diaal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl ɛ jiök i̱, “Cuŋni! Bä ji̱ la̱r min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱tdä min wa̱r.” Kä cu Thɔɔl ɛ jiök i̱, “Latdɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “A cäŋ guici rɔɔdu a kuiyi waaŋdu, /ciɛ ji̱n bööth thuk duëli I-thɛ-rɛl? Ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ yier ala kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cɛ ji̱ ja̱k i̱, ‘Wër däk nɛy tɔ̱ ji̱ dueeri tɔ̱tɔ̱, ji̱ Ä-ma-lek, wër nyieenyni kɛ kɛ amäni mi cikɛ thuk.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuɛ la ŋu /keni ruac Kuɔth Nhial liŋ ɔ? Ɛŋu curi ku lɛ la̱t ni mi jiääk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial ɔ, a bi kɔŋ ni kuak ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl Tha-muɛl jiök i̱, “Ɣän cä ruac Kuɔth Nhial liŋ, cä wä jäkädɛ, cä ji̱ Ä-ma-lek näk kɛn diaal, kä cä Ä-gag kuääriɛn nööŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /kenɛ naath ɣɔ̱k tin ca pɛ̈c näk, kɛ ɣöö bakɛ ben thöp Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu ala muc kä Gil-gal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl Tha-muɛl jiök i̱, “Ɣän cä duer. Kɛ ɣöö cä ruac Kuɔth Nhial lo̱k kɛnɛ ruacdu, kɛ ɣöö cä dual kɛ naath a cä liŋ ni ruacdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ, ɣän la̱ŋä ni ji̱, päli ɣä duerä, kä luɔcnɛ jɔk kɛɛl kɛ ɣöö dëë Kuoth Nhial wä pal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl ɛ loc i̱, “Cä bi loc jɔk kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ kɛ ɣöö ci riet Kuɔth Nhial lo̱k, kä cɛ ji̱ lo̱k kɛ ɣöö bia̱ kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min jiɛɛn Tha-muɛl, cu Thɔɔl bi̱i̱dɛ käp, kä cuɛ rɛ̈ɛ̈t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl ɛ jiök i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl rɛ̈t kä ji̱ ɛn walɛ kä cɛ jɛ ka̱m gua̱n thieekädu, mi gɔaa ni jɛn kä ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl kac bi kac, kä cɛ rɔ bi ri̱t. Kɛ ɣöö ciɛ raan, ɛ derɛ rɔ ri̱t.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl wee i̱, “Ɣän cä duer. Kä täämɛ ku ɣä moc kɛ luth nhiam bööthnikä kɛnɛ nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, rietnɛ rɔ kɛɛl, kɛ ɣöö dëë Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu wä pal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu Tha-muɛl wä kɛɛl kɛ jɛ, kä cu Thɔɔl Kuoth Nhial pal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
