        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl wee i̱, “Nöŋ ni ɣä Ä-gag kuäär ji̱ Ä-ma-lek.” Kä cu Ä-gag ben kä jɛ kɛ ŋa̱th wee i̱, “Ɛ puc ci gua̱a̱th li̱eth thuɔ̱k.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl wee i̱, “Ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci thɛpdu män jak kä thil gaat, inɔ bä bi muɔɔr thil gat rɛy mään.” Cu Tha-muɛl Ä-gag näk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial kä Gil-gal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
